  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>當我們將<span style=\"color:#f0f\">「蠑螈桶」</span>放入熔爐時，它會被煮沸。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>煮熟的蠑螈的<span style=\"color:#800000\">營養值</span>和<span style=\"color:#930\">飽食度</span>與<span style=\"color:#f60\">「鮭魚」</span>相同（6點營養值（3格飢餓值），9.6點飽食度）。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>食用煮熟的蠑螈會獲得<span style=\"color:#936\">再生</span>效果（持續1分鐘）。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EGTFk4lkh8Y?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>",
